{"id":"b73c178d9ab1abe7","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-koenig.md","title":"二叉树的紧致性","display":"thm-koenig — 二叉树的紧致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-koenig","aliases":["43-thm-koenig"],"display":"thm-koenig — 二叉树的紧致性","depends_on":["[[43-df-tree]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Proof of Proposition 5.16.4 invokes König lemma, print p.63 / PDF p.83","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-koenig"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-koenig</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-koenig — 二叉树的紧致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"64d83554d467a24a\" href=\"?note=64d83554d467a24a\" title=\"43-df-tree\">43-df-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Proof of Proposition 5.16.4 invokes König lemma, print p.63 / PDF p.83"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>为树。</p>\n<p>本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"64d83554d467a24a\" href=\"?note=64d83554d467a24a\" title=\"43-df-tree\">43-df-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\Rightarrow([T]\\ne\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in T\\ (|\\sigma|=n)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\Rightarrow([T]\\ne\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in T\\ (|\\sigma|=n)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐步选择仍有任意长延伸的一个子节点；有限分支确保至少一个子节点保留这一性质。空树与仅有限层树均给空路径集。</p>\n<p>来源：Proof of Proposition 5.16.4 invokes König lemma, print p.63 / PDF p.83。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"64d83554d467a24a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-tree","status":"resolved","id":"64d83554d467a24a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-tree]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tree}(T)\\Rightarrow([T]\\ne\\varnothing\\leftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in T\\ (|\\sigma|=n)).","display":true}],"bytes":1058,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-koenig]] — 二叉树的紧致性"}],"outgoing":["64d83554d467a24a"]}